## Görsel dil

- **Story Ember** — dark first, layered surfaces, Warm Ember Orange under 8% of screen
- Altı eşit pillar; Reviews merkez değil
- 8 imza bileşen (Game Card, Review Ledger, Post Card, Profile Header, Collection Shelf, Tier Canvas, GameLog Timeline, Activity Feed)
- 8pt spacing grid; arbitrary spacing yok
- Typography hierarchy > color
- Creator Economy: premium/creator enhance eder, core culture paywall olmaz; purple identity accents
- Mobile-first, Desktop-ready: tek component sistemi; layout adapts, meaning does not
- WCAG 2.2 AA minimum; `SPRINT_F2_18_ACCESSIBILITY_GLOBAL_EXPERIENCE.md` constitution + `ACCESSIBILITY.md` detail
- Touch target 48×48dp min; renk tek başına indicator olamaz; screen reader: label, role, state, value
- Reduced motion, keyboard nav (web), RTL, dynamic type destekle
- Component naming: `Category / Variant / State`
- Recognizability filter: *Does this make GMRLOG more recognizable?*

## Davranış

- Hardcoded renk/spacing kullanma; `packages/design-tokens` ve semantic tokens (`docs/02_DESIGN/DESIGN_TOKENS.md`)
- Token hierarchy: Primitive → Semantic → Component → Theme; primitive colors component'te doğrudan kullanılmaz
- Naming: `category.property.variant` (ör. `color.background.primary`, `space.6`)
- Figma = kod 1:1 mapping (`FIGMA_CONVENTIONS.md`); frame naming: `DOMAIN / SCREEN / STATE`
- Tokens Figma'dan export; manuel duplication yasak
- Motion: 180–250ms core, no bounce (`animation.mdc` + Master §6)
